# Database Schema Overview

This report is based on the Prisma schema in [backend/prisma/schema.prisma](backend/prisma/schema.prisma) and reflects the database design for the website/cms backend.

## 1. Database summary
- Database provider: PostgreSQL
- ORM: Prisma
- ID strategy: UUIDs for most tables
- Soft-delete pattern: most tables include a nullable `deletedAt` column
- Relationship style: mostly one-to-many and standalone content tables; no explicit many-to-many model is present

